SUMMARY:Deadline: GMAC Film: Little Pictures 2026/27 (Scotland)
DESCRIPTION:GMAC Film's Little Pictures scheme funds Scotland-based filmmak
 ers making their first funded short film\, with up to GBP 6\,000 productio
 n funding per film plus a year of training\, workshops\, industry mentorsh
 ip and free access to equipment and resources. Fiction\, documentary\, ani
 mation and experimental work are all eligible\, and the scheme has produce
 d over 50 films across Scotland in its six years\, prioritizing underrepre
 sented voices in the screen sector. ELIGIBILITY: 18+\, based anywhere in S
 cotland\, not in full-time education\, and not previously commissioned to 
 make a film (Opening Shot alumni excepted)\; no prior filmmaking experienc
 e required\, and separate tracks exist for filmmakers and producers. Acces
 s support provisions are available for applicants facing additional barrie
 rs. Deadline: 9 September 2026\, 10am.\n\nOrganisation: GMAC Film (Glasgow
  Media Access Centre)\nLocation: Scotland\, UK\nAward: Up to GBP 6\,000 pr
 oduction funding per film\, plus training\, workshops\, industry mentorshi
 p and free equipment and resource access\nDuration: Year-long programme\n\
 nMore: https://www.gmacfilm.com/little-pictures/?utm_source=artificialnouv
 eaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.gmacfilm.com/little-pictures/?utm_source=artificialnouveaug
 rantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Scotland\, UK
END:VEVENT
