SUMMARY:Deadline: Bradford Textile Society: Design Competition 2026-27 (UK)
DESCRIPTION:The Bradford Textile Society\, which has run its design competi
 tion since 1893\, awards a collective GBP 17\,000 across textile categorie
 s in the 2027 cycle. CATEGORIES: weave\, knit\, print\, embroidery\, combi
 ned textile processes\, mixed media and new technologies\, the last being 
 a natural home for e-textile and smart-textile work\; a new Coldharbour Mi
 ll Award for Tartan is added for 2027. ELIGIBILITY: all UK-based students 
 and independent designers are welcome to enter. KEY DATES: entries open 22
  March 2027 and close at midnight on 7 May 2027\; the entry portal is curr
 ently closed between cycles\, but the deadline and categories are publishe
 d now. No entry fee is stated on the competition page.\n\nOrganisation: Br
 adford Textile Society\nLocation: UK. Open to all UK-based students and in
 dependent designers.\nAward: A collective GBP 17\,000 in awards across a w
 ide spectrum of textile specialities. No entry fee is stated on the compet
 ition page.\nDuration: Annual competition\; entries open 22 March 2027 and
  close 7 May 2027.\n\nMore: https://bradfordtextilesociety.org.uk/competit
 ions/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://bradfordtextilesociety.org.uk/competitions/?utm_source=artifici
 alnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:UK. Open to all UK-based students and independent designers.
